Garry's Mod has inspired virtual creativity in many people, including employees of PixelTail Games, which is developing a game based on it. Tower UniteHowever, this project should be called more of a game universe. It has everything needed for online interaction.

After trying to download Tower Unite via torrent, you just need to live:
- to furnish the house;
- dress as you like;
- to throw parties;
- watch videos on YouTube;
- meet interesting people;
- fly using jetpacks and other devices...

Yes, yes, we are talking about a relative of Anarchy Arcade, however Tower Unite A unique and inimitable project in its own right. The process will begin in a private home, known here as a condo. After leaving, you can enjoy the various attractions and even create one yourself — for example, why not build something reminiscent of an Egyptian pyramid? It's important to let your imagination run wild, so we recommend starting your search for ideas right now!

To make it even more fun, Tower Unite has brought together a variety of online games. All sorts of genres are offered: shooters, puzzles, sports simulators, and more. Up to 18 players can play minigames simultaneously (depending on the rules), so a wild ride is guaranteed! Initially, the developers plan to implement 10 game subworlds, with more to come. The reader will likely ask: "Initially" — when? Full version Tower Unite is due out in March 2016, with early access expected to open as early as December 2015.

To create a truly beautiful experience, the developers used the Unreal 4 engine, and support for 4K resolution is reported. So, some gamers might want to consider buying a new monitor. Yes, a monitor, not a TV, since it's being created Tower Unite for computer platforms such as Windows, OS X, and Linux. This gaming universe will be distributed via Steam.

